# ===== Dependencies (Node) =====
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# ===== Build output =====
dist/
dist2/
build/
out/
**/dist/
**/build/
.target/

# ===== Verification build artifacts (构建验证临时产物，非交付物) =====
dist-verify/
**/dist-verify/
# 覆盖带后缀的临时验证产物（dist-verify2 / dist-verify4 / dist-verify-final 等）。
# 构建验证常改用全新 --outDir 以规避沙箱 safe-delete 对既有 dist 清空的拦截，
# 若不通配，每换一次 outDir 都会污染 git status。
**/dist-verify*/

# ===== Logs =====
*.log
logs/
**/logs/

# ===== Secrets / credential backups — NEVER commit =====
.credential-rotation-backup*/
**/.credential-rotation-backup*/
*.env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example
secrets/
**/secrets/

# ===== Go vendor =====
vendor/

